   486	
   487	When review discussion has converged, any participant (typically the implementer) drafts `ideas/<slug>/review/consensus.md`:
   488	
   489	    ---
   490	    idea: <slug>
   491	    review-cycle: N
   492	    drafted-by: <agent-id>
   493	    date: YYYY-MM-DD
   494	    reviewed-commit: <sha>
   495	    ---
   496	
