   700	
   701	Consult artifacts (`parley-deck/consults/`, written by `parley consult`) are
   702	advisory and non-canonical: they are never round artifacts, signoffs, quorum
   703	evidence, or dispositions. Promoting a consult's conclusion into protocol state
