   717	  `meta/version.json` `protocolRole`:
   718	  - `source` → **advisory only; never auto-writes `COOPERATION.md`** (this project is
   719	    the protocol's upstream, so a packaged copy is older, not newer).
   720	  - `consumer` + a newer installed protocol → an **additive** change (a `deckVersion`
   721	    minor/patch bump) is **auto-synced** into `COOPERATION.md`, **preserving every
